  "prefLabel": "Ac 104.01 Public Access",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ac 104.01 Public Access. In accordance with RSA 91-A, any person may examine all public, non-exempt governmental records in the possession of the board, at the offices of the board, between 8:00 a.m. and 4:00 p.m., Monday through Friday.\n\nSource. #10053, eff 1-1-12 (from Ac 103.01)",
